<title>USA: Republic Group votes 10 pct stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Republic Group votes 10 pct stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>HUTCHINSON, Kan. 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Republic Group Inc said on Wednesday its board voted a 10 percent stock dividend and a regular $0.09 a share cash dividend to be paid March 14, to shareholders of record on February 28.</p>
<p>The cash dividend will be paid on post stock dividend whole shares of common stock.  </p>
<p>At the end of the company's December 31 second quarter, there were about 10.6 million average shares outstanding.</p>
<p>Each additional share of common stock will be accompanied by one common stock purchase right, the company said.</p>
<p>Republic Group manufactures recycled paperboard, recovered fiber and gypsum wallboard.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
